      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_077/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7915
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "A crowd cheering is loud. Ears ring after a big cheer, and hearing does not grow back.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_077/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_077/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7418,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_077/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9064
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "To hear is not to listen. Ears hear all day; you listen when you pick one dear voice out.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_077/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_077/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7523,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_077/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 10475
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "Ear wax is not dirt. It is gear: it traps dust, so ears clean out on their own.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_077/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_077/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8568,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_077/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9482
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "The gear near your ear has one more job: it keeps you standing up. Spin, and your ears spin too.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_077/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_077/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8568,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
